---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Hubungi Kami"
  description="Hubungi tim Senara untuk pertanyaan, masukan, atau peluang kolaborasi."
  canonical="https://senara.id/contact"
  pageName="contact"
  bodyDataPage="contact"
  schema={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Contact Us | Senara",
    "description": "Get in touch with the Senara team for questions, feedback, or collaboration opportunities.",
    "url": "https://senara.id/contact",
    "isPartOf": {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "name": "Senara",
      "url": "https://senara.id/"
    }
  })}
>
  <div class="page-bg"></div>

  <header class="page-header py-16 md:py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0F172A] mb-4" data-i18n="contact.title">
        Hubungi Kami
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#64748B] max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-i18n="contact.subtitle">
        Kami senang mendengar dari kamu.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="py-12 md:py-16 px-4">
    <div class="page-content">

      <p class="intro-text" data-i18n="contact.intro">
        Punya pertanyaan, masukan, atau sekadar ingin menyapa? Jangan ragu untuk menghubungi kami. Setiap pesan dibaca dan kami akan berusaha membalas secepat mungkin.
      </p>

      <div class="contact-grid">

        <div class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg></div>
          <h2 data-i18n="contact.generalTitle">Pertanyaan Umum</h2>
          <p data-i18n="contact.generalDesc">
            Untuk pertanyaan, masukan, laporan bug, atau sekadar ngobrol tentang Senara.
          </p>
          <a href="mailto:fauzan08fauzan@gmail.com" class="contact-link" data-umami-event="Kontak email umum" data-i18n="contact.generalButton">
            Kirim Email
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-card partnership-card">
          <div class="contact-icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"/><polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"/></svg></div>
          <h2 data-i18n="contact.contribTitle">Kontribusi & Kemitraan</h2>
          <p data-i18n="contact.contribDesc">
            Ingin berkontribusi sebagai relawan atau berkolaborasi sebagai organisasi? Kunjungi halaman khusus kami.
          </p>
          <a href="/about?tab=contribute" class="contact-link partnership-link" data-umami-event="Kontak ke contribute" data-i18n="contact.contribButton">
            Lihat Peluang
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="response-note">
        <p data-i18n-html="contact.responseNote"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/></svg> Kami biasanya membalas dalam 2-3 hari kerja. Untuk pertanyaan umum, cek juga halaman <a href="/faq" style="color: #F97316; text-decoration: underline;">FAQ</a> kami.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="social-section">
        <h3 data-i18n="contact.socialTitle">Ikuti Perkembangan Senara</h3>
        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="https://trakteer.id/senara.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-link" data-umami-event="Kontak Trakteer" data-i18n="contact.socialLinks.trakteer">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 000-7.78z"/></svg> Trakteer
          </a>
          <a href="https://instagram.com/idsenara" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-link" data-umami-event="Kontak Instagram" data-i18n="contact.socialLinks.instagram">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V8a2 2 0 012-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg> Instagram
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
